file tools/fixtures/g/guard_cpu_census.sh the new probe -- --top N, --every K, --guard NAME; runs each guard inside sh -c '<guard>; times' and reads line two, so sys_share costs a shell wrapper; refuses no_run_card, no_roster, not_a_git_tree and an unknown flag; reported, rostered nowhere, by the precedent of its strace sibling
